{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioGithubPublish",
  "$description": "Create GitHub Repository: the three things the flow needs before it calls the API — the repository's name, an optional description, and whether it is private. A `jx-dialog`, so the platform owns modality, Escape, focus restoration and the backdrop, and the kit draws both answer buttons. Nothing here reaches GitHub: `github/github-publish.ts` keeps the token, the request and the activity, and this document only collects.",
  "tagName": "jx-dialog",
  "$props": {
    "headline": "Create GitHub Repository",
    "confirmLabel": "Create Repository",
    "cancelLabel": "Cancel",
    "size": "sm"
  },
  "attributes": {
    "part": "github-publish"
  },
  "onconfirm": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/confirm"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "oncancel": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/cancel"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "onclose": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/closed"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "What is NOT here is most of the conversion. `.github-publish-dialog` was a flex column with an 8px gap and `8px 0` of padding: the gap is the one thing it said that nothing else draws, and `jx-dialog`'s own body already pads the content, so only the gap survives. `.github-publish-dialog sp-textfield { width: 100% }` had nothing to transcribe either — a `jx-field` row is a grid whose control cell stretches, so the field fills the row without being told to. The three `sp-field-label`s are gone with them, because `jx-field` draws the label AND names the control from it; the third of them carried no `for` at all, so \"Visibility\" was text beside a switch rather than a name for it.",
    "& [part=\"rows\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "rows"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-field",
          "$props": {
            "span": true,
            "label": "Repository name"
          },
          "attributes": {
            "part": "row",
            "data-field": "name"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-textfield",
              "$props": {
                "placeholder": "my-project",
                "value": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/name"
                }
              },
              "attributes": {
                "part": "field"
              },
              "oninput": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/setName"
                    },
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-field",
          "$props": {
            "span": true,
            "label": "Description (optional)"
          },
          "attributes": {
            "part": "row",
            "data-field": "description"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-textfield",
              "$props": {
                "placeholder": "A brief description",
                "value": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/description"
                }
              },
              "attributes": {
                "part": "field"
              },
              "oninput": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/setDescription"
                    },
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-field",
          "$props": {
            "span": true,
            "label": "Visibility"
          },
          "attributes": {
            "part": "row",
            "data-field": "visibility"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "$description": "The row opens with a plain `div`, and that is the whole reason it exists: `jx-field` names the first thing slotted into it that observes `labelledby`, so a switch slotted straight in would be announced \"Visibility\" over the top of the words printed beside it. A `div` observes no naming, so the switch keeps the name its own label gives it.",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "visibility-row"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-switch",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "toggle"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "checked": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/isPrivate"
                    }
                  },
                  "onchange": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/setPrivate"
                        },
                        "value": [
                          {
                            "$ref": "event#/target/checked"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "textContent": "Private repository"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
